    <alternateIdentifier
        system="https://doi.org">doi:10.6073/pasta/4a8cbfc4011ff759a0b5a3f08d7fc872</alternateIdentifier><title>Environmental and behavioral sensor data to identify heat stress in dairy cows</title>
